ttom: 12px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .list-item {\n        font-size: 17px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin-bottom: 6px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .label-container {\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"main-title\">桂林景点指南</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder ph-1\">[Illustration: Elephant Trunk Hill with raft]</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">象鼻山</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"label-container\">\n            <span class=\"label\">门票：</span><span class=\"inline-text\">免费</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <div class=\"label\">交通：</div>\n            <p class=\"block-text\">16路公交车在象山公园站下车；100路公交车阳桥站下车后步行700米</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <div class=\"label\">游玩小指南：</div>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">1、推荐从1号门进园，3号门出园，可以完整的浏览象山不走回头路</p>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">2、不要坐这里的竹筏，电动竹筏行程距离短，而且市区风景并不算好</p>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">3、爬象山要绕到水月洞那边才有路上山，里面的竹筏不推荐乘坐，性价比不高</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder ph-2\">[Illustration: Mountains and sun]</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">芦笛岩</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"label-container\">\n            <span class=\"label\">门票：</span><span class=\"inline-text\">90</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <div class=\"label\">交通：</div>\n            <p class=\"block-text\">3路公交车大约40分钟抵达芦笛岩，打车20分钟</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <div class=\"label\">游玩小指南：</div>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">1、网络票强制要求1小时后才能使用，不要到了门口才去网上买票</p>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">2、溶洞最佳拍照点有两个，一个在水帘洞，另一个是水帘洞后面的倒影池水旁</p>\n            <p class=\"list-item\">3、不要坐小火车，走路很快就能到洞口了</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
